# 💸 SpendWise – Expense Tracker

A responsive web app to log daily expenses, filter by month, and see a category-wise spending breakdown.

**Live demo:** _add your GitHub Pages link here_

## Features
- Add and delete expenses (title, amount, category, date)
- Filter by month
- Category breakdown with percentage bars
- Data saved in the browser (localStorage), so it persists after refresh
- Responsive layout and automatic dark mode

## Tech Stack
HTML5 · CSS3 (Grid, CSS variables) · Vanilla JavaScript (ES6)

## Run Locally
1. Clone the repo: `git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/spendwise-expense-tracker.git`
2. Open `index.html` in your browser. No build step needed.

## What I Learned
- DOM manipulation and event delegation
- Persisting state with localStorage and safe JSON parsing
- Escaping user input to prevent XSS
- Responsive and theme-aware CSS

## Future Improvements
- Backend with user login (Node.js + MongoDB)
- Charts with Chart.js
- Export to CSV

